WEBVTT

00:03:28.530 --> 00:03:30.130
four more weeks of previews.

00:03:30.130 --> 00:03:32.397
And now it's November,
and it's opening night.

00:03:32.963 --> 00:03:39.030
My family, which consists
of my mother, my two aunts,

00:03:39.063 --> 00:03:41.463
my two cousins and my 91-year-old granny

00:03:41.497 --> 00:03:44.063
fly up to support.

00:03:44.797 --> 00:03:49.597
They are drenched -- drenched --
in Southern pride

00:03:49.630 --> 00:03:51.663
and basking in familial glory

00:03:51.697 --> 00:03:55.463
as Tina Turner pretends to give me a light
smacking around at the curtain call,

00:03:55.497 --> 00:03:57.063
in front of 1,500 people.

00:03:58.497 --> 00:04:00.497
(Tapping sounds)